Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0427-starbite-m11a-usb-controller.patch - StarbiteUSB
 (DWC3 device controller + CDC-NCM function + built-in ping responder; copy of
 starbite/apple-drivers/StarbiteUSB at 0d957fd, STARLTE-only build units) on
 the board ADT's starbite,dwc3 nub, off unless sbusb=1; StarbiteUSBNCM
 (IONetworkingFamily) not built; sbstop_s=S: an sbstop test boot that has not
 reached its stage by S s of uptime stops anyway with the console tail in pmsg
 ("STAGE NOT REACHED")

